    "description": "Visit the website of the bank you wish to apply for the kisan credit card scheme. From the list of options, choose the Kisan Credit Card. On clicking the option of ‘Apply’, the website will redirect you to the application page. Fill the form with the required details and click on ‘Submit’. On doing so, an application reference number will be sent. If you are eligible, the bank will get back to you for the further process within 3-4 working days."
