    "description": "The students will be eligible to receive scholarships and contingent grants from the date of joining the course. Procedure of Selection: 1. A tentative distribution of scholarships will first be made to various agricultural universities on the basis of seats reserved by the individual agricultural universities for SC/ST candidates. 2. The actual number of scholarships allotted to the universities every year would, however, be determined on the ba"
