  "summaryText": "A scholarship scheme by Ministry of Social Justice & Empowerment for regular, full-time students from Scheduled Castes studying in Class 9th and 10th in a Govt.",
  "financialBenefit": "Monthly scholarship up to Rs. 525 and annual books/ad-hoc grant up to Rs. 1000 for SC students.",
