    "description": "Press the Logout button. Intimation of Selection As the Department receives a large number of applications, the selection process on average takes at least four months from the last date of submission of the application. All selected candidates shall receive a Provisional Offer Letter on their web portal account informing them that they are selected for the scholarship. Provisionally selected students are required to log into the online portal to"
