  "shortTitle": "PMV",
  "category": "Entrepreneurship / MSME",
  "level": "Central",
  "ministryOrDepartment": "Ministry Of Micro, Small and Medium Enterprises",
  "description": "The scheme \"PM Vishwakarma \" by the Ministry of Micro, Small & Medium Enterprises, is a new scheme that envisages providing end-to-end holistic support to traditional artisans and craftspeople in scaling up their conventional products and services.",
  "summaryText": "The scheme \"PM Vishwakarma \" by the Ministry of Micro, Small & Medium Enterprises, is a new scheme that envisages providing end-to-end holistic support to traditional artisans and craftspeople in scaling up their conven…",
  "financialBenefit": "Offers recognition, skill training with ₹500 per day stipend, and a ₹15,000 toolkit incentive grant.",
