    "title": "Step 2",
    "description": "On the \"Registration Now\" Page, answer the Set of Questions as Yes/No, and click \"Continue\". On the \"Aadhaar Verification\" Page, enter the 6-digit OTP received on your Aadhaar-linked Mobile Number. Click \"Continue\". On the next page, enter your Aadhaar Number and the Aadhaar Registered Mobile Number. Click \"Continue\". Application:"
