  "description": "\"Uttar Pradesh Mukhyamantri Bal Seva Yojana (General)\" scheme provides financial assistance to children in Uttar Pradesh who face various hardships.",
  "summaryText": "\"Uttar Pradesh Mukhyamantri Bal Seva Yojana (General)\" scheme provides financial assistance to children in Uttar Pradesh who face various hardships.",
  "financialBenefit": "Financial assistance of ₹2,500 per month provided to eligible children.",
  "financialBenefitAmount": 30000,
