    "description": "The applications are invited through advertisement and to be submitted online when notified. Scrutiny of the Application: Applications will be screened by an expert committee consisting of experts nominated by the Commission. Short-listed candidates will have to appear for an interview /presentation which can be either in person or through Skype or similar Tele-mode. Selected candidates have to execute an agreement accepting the terms and conditi"
