    "description": "Applicants have to visit the Gram Panchayat / Janpad Panchayat in rural areas and Municipal Corporation / Municipality / City Council in urban areas. Get the application form and fill it with the required information. Attach the necessary document. Get the acknowledgement from the concerned office."
