  "detailsText": [
   "The scheme &quot;Biju Yuva Sashaktikaran Yojana&quot; has been implemented by the Department of Higher Education, Govt. of Odisha. In this scheme, ₹30,000/- per student is transferred directly to the bank accounts of 15,000 meritorious +2 students through Direct Benefit Transfer (DBT) for the purchase of a laptop. The allocation earmarked to SC &amp; ST students in a particular stream is bifurcated between SC and ST as per the ratio 16.25:22.5, which is also the reservation ratio in employment in the State. The scheme is applicable to students from the CHSE Board and Upshastri Students passing from Shree Jagannath Sanskrit University, Puri."
  ],
  "benefitsText": [
   "An amount of ₹30,000/- per student is transferred directly to the bank accounts of 15,000 meritorious +2 students through Direct Benefit Transfer (DBT) for the purchase of laptop."
  ],
