  "summaryText": "In order to improve the process in curbing the high rate of mortality and infant mortality rate, the Department of Women and Child Development, Government of Odisha introduced a scheme named \"MAMATA\" - a conditional cas…",
  "financialBenefit": "Financial assistance of Rs.3,000 is given during the third trimester of pregnancy for the first two live births.",
