    "title": "Step 05",
    "description": "Fill in all the details asked in the online application form and submit the application form. HBOCW Registration User Manual Change of address: It shall be obligatory for a beneficiary to intimate any change of address to the District Social Welfare Officer. A beneficiary shifting to a place outside Haryana State for a period exceeding three months shall not be ordinarily eligible for payment of Financial Assistance during the period of his/her s"
