    "title": "Step 01",
    "description": "Farmers may visit the Primary Agriculture Credit Societies (PACS) or Large Area Multipurpose Cooperative Societies (LAMPS) centers in your region and obtain the application form for the \"Paddy Procurement Scheme\"."
