    "description": "The interested applicant should take a printout of the prescribed format of the application form. Alternatively, the interested applicant should visit one of the following Offices and request a hard copy of the prescribed format of the application form from the designated staff: Office of the Director, Tribal Welfare, Panaji-Goa Office of the Deputy Director, Tribal Welfare, Margao-Goa"
