    "description": "Notification of Application Cycle The Directorate of Art and Culture releases an advertisement or press note on local daily newspapers, officially inviting applications from eligible students for availing benefits under this scheme. Applicants are advised to monitor the local daily newspapers for the release of this advertisement, as it signals the official opening of the application window."
