  "ministryOrDepartment": "Directorate of Minority Welfare, Government of Kerala",
  "description": "The scheme \"Imbichi Bawa Housing Renovation Scheme\" by the Minority Welfare Department, Government of Kerala, aims to improve the basic facilities of houses belonging to widowed, divorced, or abandoned women from minority religious communities.",
  "summaryText": "The scheme \"Imbichi Bawa Housing Renovation Scheme\" by the Minority Welfare Department, Government of Kerala, aims to improve the basic facilities of houses belonging to widowed, divorced, or abandoned women from minori…",
