   "Annexure - III ( Self-Declaration)",
   "Proof of Age and Identification ( 10th Admit Card / 10th Certificate / Transfer Certificate or Birth Certificate).",
   "Proof of Residence (Aadhaar Card).",
   "Caste - Caste Certificate (if in case other than General caste).",
