    "title": "Step 1",
    "description": "Registration Process : Applicant first visit the official website h ttps://www.employmentbankwb.gov.in/ Click on \" New Enrolment Job Seeker \" on the portal and accept the \"Terms and Condition\". On the new Enrolment page applicant need to full fill the following details Personal Information : Contact Information : Education Details Language Physical Measurement Experience Details : Additional Information : Upload Photo / CV After provide the above"
