    "description": "The application process for the Dalit Bandhu scheme in Telangana is as follows: Eligible applicants can obtain the application form from the website of the Telangana State Scheduled Castes Development Corporation (TSSCDC). The application form must be duly filled in and submitted along with the required documents to the TSSCDC office in the applicant's district. The required documents include proof of identity, proof of residence, proof of age, p"
