  "description": "The \"Indirect Tax Internship Scheme\" by CBIC takes Law Students/ Graduates as Interns every year. The interns are expected to study case files, assist in legal research and drafting of petitions, brief the counsels and extend any other related legal/general assistance to officers/counsels.",
  "summaryText": "The \"Indirect Tax Internship Scheme\" by CBIC takes Law Students/ Graduates as Interns every year.",
