  "summaryText": "The scheme of \"Free Education for Sports Medal Winners / Participants of National/ International Events\" is introduced by UGC, to provide financial assistance to the medal winners\\ elite sports persons studying in unive…",
  "financialBenefit": "Scholarships covering tuition fees, hostel facilities, allowances, and 15000 rupees per annum for kit.",
