    "description": "The proposals for the Distinguished Chair Professor fellowship will be by nomination only. The nominations with all necessary details can be sent throughout the year to the following address: The Director (Faculty Development Cell) AICTE, Nelson Mandela Marg, Vasant Kunj, New Delhi-110070 Director.fdc@aicte-india.org"
