   "Service Certificate to be issued by the H.O.O in case of serving personnel as per Annexure-A.",
   "Applicants are required to upload a duly attested scanned copy of the Mark sheet MEQ i.e. XII/Diploma/Graduation or equivalent is mandatory along with the following certificate which is applicable:",
