  "description": "In order to promote soil test analysis in a campaign mode and to create awareness among farmers about soil health for judicious use of chemical fertilisers, organic manure, the component of “Setting of Village-level Soil Testing Laboratories” is being implemented under the scheme.",
  "summaryText": "In order to promote soil test analysis in a campaign mode and to create awareness among farmers about soil health for judicious use of chemical fertilisers, organic manure, the component of “Setting of Village-level Soi…",
  "financialBenefit": "Establish village level soil testing labs with affordable access to soil tests.",
  "financialBenefitAmount": 0,
